A \code{CO} request is rejected before downloading unless \code{allow_large = TRUE}.
That opt-in does not remove the independent \code{max_rows} materialisation
bound. Responses are fetched over HTTPS from the official BOJ host and
successfully cached as content-addressed snapshots. A current snapshot is
reused unless \code{refresh = TRUE}; \code{offline = TRUE} requires a valid matching
snapshot and makes no network request. See \code{\link[=read_boj_series]{read_boj_series()}} for the
